phi-adapter-z2m (0.0~git202608291355.05e4590-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * What bridge/info says about the radio - the serial adapter Zigbee2MQTT
    opened the stick with, the coordinator and its firmware, the port, the
    channel, the PAN id - is reported as soon as it arrives. It used to wait for
    the coordinator to turn up as a device, and bridge/info normally arrives
    first, so a fresh installation reported nothing about its own radio.

